    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">You gain the @UUID[Compendium.vagabond-app.perks.Item.1A4MdMdz7EAAoMzI]{Gish} Perk, and can Cast Spells using Leadership.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Spells:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> You learn 2 Spells, one of which must always have a damage base. You learn 1 other Spell every 3 Levels hereafter.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Mana:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Your Max Mana is equal to (2 × your Level), and your Cast Max for Spells is equal to (1 + half your Level, round up).</span></p>",
